{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# Migration: Custom Detections → Analytics Rules\n\nAbgleich der Defender-Custom-Detections (Watchlist `{Watchlist}`, Export per Skript) mit den Analytics Rules des Workspaces (live per ARM). Zuordnung über den Regelnamen, ohne Groß-/Kleinschreibung; abweichende Namen über die Spalte `AnalyticsRuleName` in der Watchlist.\n\n| Status | Bedeutung |\n|---|---|\n| **Offen** | Keine Analytics Rule mit passendem Namen |\n| **AR inaktiv** | Analytics Rule angelegt (z. B. per Template-Import), aber noch deaktiviert → prüfen und aktivieren |\n| **Parallelbetrieb** | Analytics Rule existiert, Custom Detection noch aktiv → Alerts vergleichen, dann Custom Detection deaktivieren |\n| **Abgeschlossen** | Analytics Rule existiert, Custom Detection deaktiviert |\n| *eigener Wert* | Aus Spalte `ManualStatus` (z. B. „Nicht migrieren“) – überschreibt die Automatik |"
      },
      "name": "intro"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "name": "parameters",
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "e60c161d-9787-455e-b600-87d21373f482",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Workspace",
            "label": "Sentinel-Workspace",
            "type": 5,
            "isRequired": true,
            "query": "resources\r\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces'\r\n| project id",
            "crossComponentResources": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "typeSettings": {
              "resourceTypeFilter": {
                "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces": true
              },
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::1"
              ],
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 1,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
            "defaultValue": "value::1"
          },
          {
            "id": "9a585a08-004d-42f2-9691-7f62a49b45b7",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "label": "Zeitraum (Alerts)",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 86400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 1209600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            },
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 1209600000
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "ef3a997d-00a2-44e2-964b-9188641b511e",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Watchlist",
            "label": "Watchlist-Alias",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "CustomDetectionRules"
          },
          {
            "id": "62f60d08-1b3c-4585-83e4-1ff34f5af1c1",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ARRules",
            "label": "Analytics Rules (live)",
            "type": 2,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "\"",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "{\"version\": \"ARMEndpoint/1.0\", \"data\": null, \"headers\": [], \"method\": \"GET\", \"path\": \"{Workspace}/providers/Microsoft.SecurityInsights/alertRules\", \"urlParams\": [{\"key\": \"api-version\", \"value\": \"2024-09-01\"}], \"batchDisabled\": false, \"transformers\": [{\"type\": \"jsonpath\", \"settings\": {\"tablePath\": \"$.value\", \"columns\": [{\"path\": \"$.properties.displayName\", \"columnid\": \"value\"}]}}]}",
            "queryType": 12,
            "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "defaultValue": "value::all"
          },
          {
            "id": "f4f49e15-37e7-4dd2-9a3b-07a2843311ff",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ARDisabled",
            "label": "Analytics Rules deaktiviert (live)",
            "type": 2,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "\"",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "{\"version\": \"ARMEndpoint/1.0\", \"data\": null, \"headers\": [], \"method\": \"GET\", \"path\": \"{Workspace}/providers/Microsoft.SecurityInsights/alertRules\", \"urlParams\": [{\"key\": \"api-version\", \"value\": \"2024-09-01\"}], \"batchDisabled\": false, \"transformers\": [{\"type\": \"jsonpath\", \"settings\": {\"tablePath\": \"$.value[?(@.properties.enabled==false)]\", \"columns\": [{\"path\": \"$.properties.displayName\", \"columnid\": \"value\"}]}}]}",
            "queryType": 12,
            "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "defaultValue": "value::all"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let AR = datatable(ARName:string)[{ARRules}]\n    | extend Key = tolower(trim(@\"\\s+\", ARName))\n    | summarize by Key\n    | extend ARExists = true;\nlet AROff = datatable(ARName:string)[{ARDisabled}]\n    | extend Key = tolower(trim(@\"\\s+\", ARName))\n    | summarize by Key\n    | extend ARInaktiv = true;\nlet CD = _GetWatchlist('{Watchlist}')\n    | extend RuleId = tostring(column_ifexists('RuleId', '')),\n             Regel = tostring(column_ifexists('DisplayName', '')),\n             AlertTitle = tostring(column_ifexists('AlertTitle', '')),\n             CDAktiv = tolower(tostring(column_ifexists('IsEnabled', ''))) == 'true',\n             Intervall = tostring(column_ifexists('Period', '')),\n             Severity = tostring(column_ifexists('Severity', '')),\n             Tabellen = tostring(column_ifexists('Tables', '')),\n             Aktionen = tostring(column_ifexists('ResponseActions', '')),\n             LetzterLauf = tostring(column_ifexists('LastRunStatus', '')),\n             ARNameOverride = tostring(column_ifexists('AnalyticsRuleName', '')),\n             ManuellerStatus = tostring(column_ifexists('ManualStatus', '')),\n             Notiz = tostring(column_ifexists('Notes', ''))\n    | extend ZielRegel = iff(isnotempty(ARNameOverride), ARNameOverride, Regel)\n    | extend Key = tolower(trim(@\"\\s+\", ZielRegel))\n    | join kind=leftouter AR on Key\n    | join kind=leftouter AROff on Key\n    | extend ARVorhanden = coalesce(ARExists, false), ARAktiv = coalesce(ARExists, false) and not(coalesce(ARInaktiv, false))\n    | extend Status = case(\n        isnotempty(ManuellerStatus), ManuellerStatus,\n        ARVorhanden and not(ARAktiv), 'AR inaktiv',\n        ARVorhanden and not(CDAktiv), 'Abgeschlossen',\n        ARVorhanden and CDAktiv, 'Parallelbetrieb',\n        'Offen');\nCD\n| summarize Anzahl = count() by Status\n| union (CD | summarize Anzahl = count() | extend Status = 'Gesamt')\n| extend Sort = case(Status == 'Gesamt', 0, Status == 'Offen', 1, Status == 'AR inaktiv', 2, Status == 'Parallelbetrieb', 3, Status == 'Abgeschlossen', 4, 5)\n| order by Sort asc\n| project Status, Anzahl",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Überblick",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Workspace}"
        ],
        "visualization": "tiles",
        "tileSettings": {
          "titleContent": {
            "columnMatch": "Status",
            "formatter": 1
          },
          "leftContent": {
            "columnMatch": "Anzahl",
            "formatter": 12,
            "formatOptions": {
              "palette": "auto"
            },
            "numberFormat": {
              "unit": 17,
              "options": {
                "style": "decimal",
                "maximumFractionDigits": 0
              }
            }
          },
          "showBorder": true
        }
      },
      "name": "tiles"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let AR = datatable(ARName:string)[{ARRules}]\n    | extend Key = tolower(trim(@\"\\s+\", ARName))\n    | summarize by Key\n    | extend ARExists = true;\nlet AROff = datatable(ARName:string)[{ARDisabled}]\n    | extend Key = tolower(trim(@\"\\s+\", ARName))\n    | summarize by Key\n    | extend ARInaktiv = true;\nlet CD = _GetWatchlist('{Watchlist}')\n    | extend RuleId = tostring(column_ifexists('RuleId', '')),\n             Regel = tostring(column_ifexists('DisplayName', '')),\n             AlertTitle = tostring(column_ifexists('AlertTitle', '')),\n             CDAktiv = tolower(tostring(column_ifexists('IsEnabled', ''))) == 'true',\n             Intervall = tostring(column_ifexists('Period', '')),\n             Severity = tostring(column_ifexists('Severity', '')),\n             Tabellen = tostring(column_ifexists('Tables', '')),\n             Aktionen = tostring(column_ifexists('ResponseActions', '')),\n             LetzterLauf = tostring(column_ifexists('LastRunStatus', '')),\n             ARNameOverride = tostring(column_ifexists('AnalyticsRuleName', '')),\n             ManuellerStatus = tostring(column_ifexists('ManualStatus', '')),\n             Notiz = tostring(column_ifexists('Notes', ''))\n    | extend ZielRegel = iff(isnotempty(ARNameOverride), ARNameOverride, Regel)\n    | extend Key = tolower(trim(@\"\\s+\", ZielRegel))\n    | join kind=leftouter AR on Key\n    | join kind=leftouter AROff on Key\n    | extend ARVorhanden = coalesce(ARExists, false), ARAktiv = coalesce(ARExists, false) and not(coalesce(ARInaktiv, false))\n    | extend Status = case(\n        isnotempty(ManuellerStatus), ManuellerStatus,\n        ARVorhanden and not(ARAktiv), 'AR inaktiv',\n        ARVorhanden and not(CDAktiv), 'Abgeschlossen',\n        ARVorhanden and CDAktiv, 'Parallelbetrieb',\n        'Offen');\nCD\n| summarize Gesamt = count(), Erledigt = countif(Status == 'Abgeschlossen'), Parallel = countif(Status == 'Parallelbetrieb'), Stand = max(todatetime(column_ifexists('LastUpdatedTimeUTC', '')))\n| project Fortschritt = strcat(round(100.0 * Erledigt / Gesamt, 0), ' % abgeschlossen'),\n          InArbeit = strcat(round(100.0 * Parallel / Gesamt, 0), ' % im Parallelbetrieb'),\n          WatchlistStand = Stand",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Fortschritt und Datenstand",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Workspace}"
        ],
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "name": "progress"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let AR = datatable(ARName:string)[{ARRules}]\n    | extend Key = tolower(trim(@\"\\s+\", ARName))\n    | summarize by Key\n    | extend ARExists = true;\nlet AROff = datatable(ARName:string)[{ARDisabled}]\n    | extend Key = tolower(trim(@\"\\s+\", ARName))\n    | summarize by Key\n    | extend ARInaktiv = true;\nlet CD = _GetWatchlist('{Watchlist}')\n    | extend RuleId = tostring(column_ifexists('RuleId', '')),\n             Regel = tostring(column_ifexists('DisplayName', '')),\n             AlertTitle = tostring(column_ifexists('AlertTitle', '')),\n             CDAktiv = tolower(tostring(column_ifexists('IsEnabled', ''))) == 'true',\n             Intervall = tostring(column_ifexists('Period', '')),\n             Severity = tostring(column_ifexists('Severity', '')),\n             Tabellen = tostring(column_ifexists('Tables', '')),\n             Aktionen = tostring(column_ifexists('ResponseActions', '')),\n             LetzterLauf = tostring(column_ifexists('LastRunStatus', '')),\n             ARNameOverride = tostring(column_ifexists('AnalyticsRuleName', '')),\n             ManuellerStatus = tostring(column_ifexists('ManualStatus', '')),\n             Notiz = tostring(column_ifexists('Notes', ''))\n    | extend ZielRegel = iff(isnotempty(ARNameOverride), ARNameOverride, Regel)\n    | extend Key = tolower(trim(@\"\\s+\", ZielRegel))\n    | join kind=leftouter AR on Key\n    | join kind=leftouter AROff on Key\n    | extend ARVorhanden = coalesce(ARExists, false), ARAktiv = coalesce(ARExists, false) and not(coalesce(ARInaktiv, false))\n    | extend Status = case(\n        isnotempty(ManuellerStatus), ManuellerStatus,\n        ARVorhanden and not(ARAktiv), 'AR inaktiv',\n        ARVorhanden and not(CDAktiv), 'Abgeschlossen',\n        ARVorhanden and CDAktiv, 'Parallelbetrieb',\n        'Offen');\nCD\n| project Status, Regel, ZielRegel, CDAktiv, ARVorhanden, ARAktiv, Severity, Intervall, Tabellen, Aktionen, LetzterLauf, Notiz, RuleId\n| extend Sort = case(Status == 'Offen', 1, Status == 'AR inaktiv', 2, Status == 'Parallelbetrieb', 3, Status == 'Abgeschlossen', 5, 4)\n| order by Sort asc, Regel asc\n| project-away Sort",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Status je Custom Detection (Zeile anklicken = Query anzeigen)",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Workspace}"
        ],
        "visualization": "table",
        "exportMultipleValues": false,
        "exportedParameters": [
          {
            "fieldName": "RuleId",
            "parameterName": "SelRuleId",
            "parameterType": 1
          },
          {
            "fieldName": "Regel",
            "parameterName": "SelRegel",
            "parameterType": 1
          },
          {
            "fieldName": "ZielRegel",
            "parameterName": "SelARName",
            "parameterType": 1
          }
        ],
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "Status",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Abgeschlossen",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Parallelbetrieb",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Offen",
                    "representation": "pending",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "AR inaktiv",
                    "representation": "disabled",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "thresholdValue": null,
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "rowLimit": 1000,
          "labelSettings": [
            {
              "columnId": "ZielRegel",
              "label": "Analytics Rule (Soll)"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "CDAktiv",
              "label": "CD aktiv"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "ARVorhanden",
              "label": "AR vorhanden"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "ARAktiv",
              "label": "AR aktiv"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "LetzterLauf",
              "label": "Letzter CD-Lauf"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "Aktionen",
              "label": "Response Actions"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "statusgrid"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "name": "detail",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelRuleId",
        "comparison": "isNotEqualTo"
      },
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 9,
            "name": "detailparams",
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "style": "pills",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "61978b6d-70fb-4c96-a40c-eff22c41dec0",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "CDQuery",
                  "type": 1,
                  "query": "_GetWatchlist('{Watchlist}')\n| where tostring(column_ifexists('RuleId', '')) == '{SelRuleId}'\n| extend Gz = tostring(column_ifexists('QueryGz', ''))\n| project Q = iff(isempty(Gz), '// Keine Query in der Watchlist - Export-Skript neu ausfuehren und Watchlist aktualisieren', gzip_decompress_from_base64_string(Gz))\n| take 1",
                  "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
                  "crossComponentResources": [
                    "{Workspace}"
                  ],
                  "queryType": 0,
                  "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
                },
                {
                  "id": "14f811df-c788-424e-967b-4e382cf20207",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "ARQuery",
                  "type": 1,
                  "query": "{\"version\": \"ARMEndpoint/1.0\", \"data\": null, \"headers\": [], \"method\": \"GET\", \"path\": \"{Workspace}/providers/Microsoft.SecurityInsights/alertRules\", \"urlParams\": [{\"key\": \"api-version\", \"value\": \"2024-09-01\"}], \"batchDisabled\": false, \"transformers\": [{\"type\": \"jsonpath\", \"settings\": {\"tablePath\": \"$.value[?(@.properties.displayName=='{SelARName}')]\", \"columns\": [{\"path\": \"$.properties.query\", \"columnid\": \"Query\"}]}}]}",
                  "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
                  "queryType": 12
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "name": "cdsettings",
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "_GetWatchlist('{Watchlist}')\n| where tostring(column_ifexists('RuleId', '')) == '{SelRuleId}'\n| take 1\n| extend Gz = tostring(column_ifexists('SettingsGz', ''))\n| extend S = iff(isempty(Gz), pack_array(bag_pack('k', 'Hinweis', 'v', 'Keine Einstellungen in der Watchlist - Export-Skript neu ausfuehren und Watchlist aktualisieren')), parse_json(gzip_decompress_from_base64_string(Gz)))\n| mv-expand S\n| project Einstellung = tostring(S.k), Wert = tostring(S.v)",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Einstellungen: {SelRegel}  (Zelle markieren und kopieren; „->“ = Vorschlag für die Analytics Rule)",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "gridSettings": {
                "rowLimit": 100,
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Einstellung",
                    "formatter": 1,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "28ch"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Wert",
                    "formatter": 1,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "120ch"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "name": "cdquery",
            "customWidth": "50",
            "content": {
              "json": "### Custom Detection: {SelRegel}\n```kusto\n{CDQuery}\n```"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "name": "arquery",
            "customWidth": "50",
            "content": {
              "json": "### Analytics Rule: {SelARName}\n```kusto\n{ARQuery}\n```\n*Leer = keine Analytics Rule mit exakt diesem Namen gefunden.*"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## Parallelbetrieb prüfen\nAlert-Zahlen im gewählten Zeitraum: Custom Detection (`AlertInfo`) gegen Analytics Rule (`SecurityAlert`). Größere Abweichungen vor dem Abschalten der Custom Detection klären. Zuordnung über Regelname bzw. Alert-Titel; dynamische Titel ({{Spalte}}) werden nicht zugeordnet."
      },
      "name": "txt-parallel"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let AR = datatable(ARName:string)[{ARRules}]\n    | extend Key = tolower(trim(@\"\\s+\", ARName))\n    | summarize by Key\n    | extend ARExists = true;\nlet AROff = datatable(ARName:string)[{ARDisabled}]\n    | extend Key = tolower(trim(@\"\\s+\", ARName))\n    | summarize by Key\n    | extend ARInaktiv = true;\nlet CD = _GetWatchlist('{Watchlist}')\n    | extend RuleId = tostring(column_ifexists('RuleId', '')),\n             Regel = tostring(column_ifexists('DisplayName', '')),\n             AlertTitle = tostring(column_ifexists('AlertTitle', '')),\n             CDAktiv = tolower(tostring(column_ifexists('IsEnabled', ''))) == 'true',\n             Intervall = tostring(column_ifexists('Period', '')),\n             Severity = tostring(column_ifexists('Severity', '')),\n             Tabellen = tostring(column_ifexists('Tables', '')),\n             Aktionen = tostring(column_ifexists('ResponseActions', '')),\n             LetzterLauf = tostring(column_ifexists('LastRunStatus', '')),\n             ARNameOverride = tostring(column_ifexists('AnalyticsRuleName', '')),\n             ManuellerStatus = tostring(column_ifexists('ManualStatus', '')),\n             Notiz = tostring(column_ifexists('Notes', ''))\n    | extend ZielRegel = iff(isnotempty(ARNameOverride), ARNameOverride, Regel)\n    | extend Key = tolower(trim(@\"\\s+\", ZielRegel))\n    | join kind=leftouter AR on Key\n    | join kind=leftouter AROff on Key\n    | extend ARVorhanden = coalesce(ARExists, false), ARAktiv = coalesce(ARExists, false) and not(coalesce(ARInaktiv, false))\n    | extend Status = case(\n        isnotempty(ManuellerStatus), ManuellerStatus,\n        ARVorhanden and not(ARAktiv), 'AR inaktiv',\n        ARVorhanden and not(CDAktiv), 'Abgeschlossen',\n        ARVorhanden and CDAktiv, 'Parallelbetrieb',\n        'Offen');\nlet CDAlerts = union isfuzzy=true\n        (datatable(Title:string, AlertId:string, DetectionSource:string)[]),\n        (AlertInfo | project Title, AlertId, DetectionSource)\n    | where DetectionSource =~ 'Custom detection'\n    | summarize CDAlerts = dcount(AlertId) by AKey = tolower(trim(@\"\\s+\", Title));\nlet ARAlerts = SecurityAlert\n    | where ProductName == 'Azure Sentinel'\n    | summarize ARAlerts = dcount(SystemAlertId) by Key = tolower(trim(@\"\\s+\", AlertName));\nCD\n| extend AKey = tolower(trim(@\"\\s+\", iff(isnotempty(AlertTitle), AlertTitle, Regel)))\n| join kind=leftouter CDAlerts on AKey\n| join kind=leftouter ARAlerts on Key\n| join kind=leftouter (ARAlerts | project AKey = Key, ARAlertsTitel = ARAlerts) on AKey\n| extend CDAlerts = coalesce(CDAlerts, 0), ARAlerts = coalesce(ARAlerts, 0) + iff(AKey != Key, coalesce(ARAlertsTitel, 0), 0)\n| extend Differenz = ARAlerts - CDAlerts\n| where Status == 'Parallelbetrieb' or CDAlerts > 0 or ARAlerts > 0\n| project Status, Regel, CDAlerts, ARAlerts, Differenz\n| order by abs(Differenz) desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Alerts: Custom Detection vs. Analytics Rule",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Workspace}"
        ],
        "visualization": "table",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "Status",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Abgeschlossen",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Parallelbetrieb",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Offen",
                    "representation": "pending",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "AR inaktiv",
                    "representation": "disabled",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "thresholdValue": null,
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "CDAlerts",
              "formatter": 4,
              "formatOptions": {
                "palette": "blue"
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "ARAlerts",
              "formatter": 4,
              "formatOptions": {
                "palette": "blue"
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "rowLimit": 1000
        }
      },
      "name": "alertcompare"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
